  <item>
    <title>16:自闭症机构志愿者自述 - 每一个人都值得认真看见</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a37b4bd75ba9e0c5336be09</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a37b4bd75ba9e0c5336be09</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 21 Jun 2026 10:01:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这集我与同自闭症青年一起工作的志愿者Sally对话，带给大家从她的视角陪伴自闭症谱系障碍青年的经历～ 神经多样性的话题，值得反复被提起；每个人，都值得被看见。</span></p><p><span>相关经历分享文字稿请见： </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/pJHDDcitxu-rkr9cUQRJ8g?token=998924787&amp;poc_token=HMmxN2qjvVCtFW5Lub6arAj2kAI2h_sKftzh8lZ9&amp;clicktag=bar_share&amp;scene=294&amp;clickpos=0&amp;from_safari=1" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/pJHDDcitxu-rkr9cUQRJ8g?token=998924787&amp;poc_token=HMmxN2qjvVCtFW5Lub6arAj2kAI2h_sKftzh8lZ9&amp;clicktag=bar_share&amp;scene=294&amp;clickpos=0&amp;from_safari=1"><strong><span>我在新加坡彩虹中心做志愿者 - 重新读懂自闭症群体</span></strong></a></p><p><span>提到单集</span><strong><span>：</span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e072c2b977fb2c471489eb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e072c2b977fb2c471489eb"><strong><span>谁在关注特需青少年</span></strong></a></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a></span></strong><span> Sally 分享自己对神经多样性群体产生兴趣的初衷及成为语言治疗师的职业理想</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="189">03:09</a></span></strong><span> 新加坡公益机构 Rainbow Center 的服务群体（GDD、ASD、脑瘫）及18岁后的社会衔接困境</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">05:11</a></span></strong><span> 自闭症谱系障碍个体的社会支持体系</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a></span></strong><span> 陪伴的起点 - 熟悉的环境， 食物</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="703">11:43</a></span></strong><span> 理解自闭症患者（ASD）的刻板坚持</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="828">13:48</a></span></strong><span> 超强的认路天赋</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="976">16:16</a></span></strong><span> 大步流星与喃喃自语</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1241">20:41</a></span></strong><span> 感受到社会里有很多善意 - 来自麦当劳阿姨的耐心&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1356">22:36</a></span></strong><span> 也有来自社会的不解声音 - 令人不适的网约车经历</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1456">24:16</a></span></strong><span> a 娃闪光点 - 惊人的坚持，专注力与极高投篮准确率</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1758">29:18</a></span></strong><span> 自闭症家庭：母亲太不容易了！！（爸爸们不好意思）</span></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
